@startuml F3.1-D01-dashboard-professor
title F3.1-D01 — Dashboard do professor
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber

actor "Professor" as Prof
participant "WebApp" as WebApp
participant "JwtFilter" as Jwt
participant "DashboardBFF" as BFF
database "Postgres" as Postgres

Prof -> WebApp: abre /inicio
WebApp -> Jwt: GET /bff/dashboard/professor
Jwt -> BFF: JWT ok
BFF -> Postgres: queries paralelas\n(KPIs, fila, eventos…)
note right of BFF
  formativasCaaf só se
  formative.review no JWT
end note
Postgres --> BFF: agregados
BFF --> WebApp: 200 + _links
WebApp --> Prof: painel HATEOAS

@enduml
